sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant P as proxy.ts
  participant S as Page or Server Action
  participant A as @repo/auth
  participant R as Redis
  participant D as Postgres

  B->>P: GET /settings/members
  alt no session cookie
    P-->>B: redirect to /sign-in?next=…
  else cookie present (optimistic check only)
    P->>S: render with a per-request CSP nonce
  end
  S->>A: getViewer(headers), cached per request
  A->>R: session by token
  opt cache miss, flush or eviction
    A->>D: session and user
  end
  A->>D: memberships and active organization
  A-->>S: Viewer (internal IDs stay on the server)
  S->>A: requireTenant, then tenant-scoped reads
  A->>D: select … where organization_id = tenant
  A-->>S: DTOs with publicIds only
  S-->>B: HTML or action result, no internal IDs
